{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"screen\": \"昂扬退潮后，忍不住问：刚才是真的相信，还是只在努力相信\",\n      \"source\": \"也可以听成：如果换一种感受，这里不像重新获得活力，更像前一段的昂扬正在慢慢退潮。音乐变得流动、含蓄、若有所思，仿佛心里冒出一句自问：我刚才是真的相信那些话，还是只是在努力让自己相信？\",\n      \"type\": 2,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿明确将昂扬退潮标为一种可选的听法，并用“仿佛”引出自问，屏幕稿却将退潮写成确定发生的过程，也把自问写成直接发生。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"screen\": \"开头的试探又把问题递回来：我究竟要怎样继续生活\",\n      \"source\": \"如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\n      \"type\": 2,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿将心理回望明确限定为一种可选解读，并用“仿佛”表达比拟，屏幕稿删掉这两层限定，变成了确定的心理过程。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cbe67063-5626-4eb2-87d1-a606b6fad8e3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T031641180923Z", "elapsed_seconds": 163.516, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T03:19:24.700235+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ce82603017ef1f4474f41fc99fda4fe43f1c14b2cd3bcce34dbf9c5d77b50d13", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgp